at products to hotels, restaurants, catering, and retail chains; builds and manages flexible and customized furnished offices, and meeting and conference room facilities, as well as provides business support services; owns commercial properties and IT spaces; and develops property for micro, small, and medium enterprises, as well as residential complexes. The company was incorporated in 1900 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":724,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1788912000,"asOf":1795774608},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774608,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Empire Industries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Obituary information for William Heimer","s":"Tierney Funeral Home","d":1793084400,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5yMjRvdGtqWkE1YWlRai1NeWRiamdiSkl3ZlNkRG1DejZhT1Bwbnk4X2hMbC10Nk9CWjBQZUVNYllQMnZhVGk4T18zRFJSLWN1S3ZyV19manRXejlxX3pKSTNsTVVCMEJHV2dHM0RCZkxrbVROMXN3TVpraUN0R0E?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Barry HALEY Obituary","s":"The Press Democrat","d":1792891653,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9MVkxMeEdtMTF4MkxwWEVJcDhmWlpzeURXRmptaGczZXBFNV9QeDZQVHR6WWNxNEUyWjhsRHhjZ2lxUnV3VVNrQ1pZcUUxM0FhNG00enU2TFJ6NmxMdTBUTzcxeV83OEstaXdkaDlhcw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Bombay HC Allows Excise Section 11BB Interest From Original Refund Application Date","s":"TaxGuru","d":1789887600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQUHgxU1ZsVmFEdnFqdjlETlhhOVNJUkVZTkhjWU9GRzlJSUVYX3ZrdDY4WUpEa082U0NJcWYyaWtyTjFsUWRlbV9iMWRwT2U2SWN6RjdBcllxNk8tbDZNc1dVZG9GbjJWbHItbGppZThfSGFnUWFhSkt2NzdPMmNtRmdqX2xLVWtsVEZFbW5lWDdfNFloMUJQbmE0LXBPUng2NVM2QmJZbWNOR0E?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Dividend stocks alert! Last chance to buy today to qualify for these shares - Check full list, amount, payment timeline","s":"Livemint","d":1788850800,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Dividend, Income Distribution Alert: 19 stocks to turn ex-date on Wednesda